WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:01.099
Good morning Hank, it's Tuesday.

00:00:01.099 --> 00:00:05.290
So today I want to tell you an amazing story
about a monkey who was hanged for treason

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:10.820
and then many years later in a roundabout
way kind of became the leader of the people

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:12.190
who had executed him.

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:13.440
But first I have to tell you how I learned
this story.

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:18.540
So Hank, as you know Nerdfighteria and I sponsor
a fourth tier fan-owned English soccer club

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:19.930
called AFC Wimbledon.

00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:23.700
We're the back of shorts sponsor; our logo
occupies that liminal space between buttock

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:24.700
and thigh.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.910
And not to brag or anything, but AFC Wimbledon
have won three straight games, including most

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:30.850
recently a two-nil defeat of Hartlepool.

00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:35.100
So I was reading up on the game and I came
across an odd headline, Hank: Don's Down Monkey

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:36.100
Hangers.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.770
This lead me to Wikipedia and you know, Hank,
usually when you fall down a Wikipedia rabbit

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:41.859
hole, nothing good comes from it, but occasionally,
monkey hangers!

00:00:41.859 --> 00:00:45.620
So, Hank, journey back with me, if you will,
to the early 19th century.

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:50.550
The French Revolution which promised democracy
and freedom and equality has failed spectacularly,

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:51.910
as revolutions often do.

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:56.600
And in the end, all they've done is replace
a despot named Louis with a despot named Napoleon.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:00.609
To celebrate his success within France, Napoleon
Bonaparte decides to start a 13 year long

00:01:00.609 --> 00:01:05.280
conflict, aptly known as the Napoleonic Wars,
in which he conquers and then eventually loses

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:08.840
most of Europe, except, of course, he never
conquers Great Britain and he also never conquers

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:14.039
Russia because you cannot invade Russia in
the winter unless you're the Mongols.

00:01:14.039 --> 00:01:18.659
So OK, the story goes, and sadly it is probably
just a story, that during the Napoleonic Wars,

00:01:18.659 --> 00:01:23.250
a French warship sank just off the coast of
Hartlepool, which I should mention, I guess,

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:25.390
is a city in the north-east of England.

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:29.950
Of course like a lot of British place names
- Sunderland, Snodland, Braintree - Hartlepool

00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:34.979
sounds like a place where hobbits live but
in fact is a real city of, like, 93,000 citizens.

00:01:34.979 --> 00:01:39.060
Right, so this French warship sinks right
off the coast and the only survivor of the

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:42.400
wreck is a monkey wearing a French Army uniform.

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:45.760
Now the good people of Hartlepool, living
as they do in the far north-east of England,

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:49.659
have never seen either a French person or
a monkey so they naturally assume that this

00:01:49.659 --> 00:01:51.280
monkey is a French spy.

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:56.020
An impromptu trial is held on the beach, the
monkey is found guilty of treason and hanged.

00:01:56.020 --> 00:01:59.710
Now what probably actually happened is that
an old folk song was adapted to history but

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:00.710
whatever!

00:02:00.710 --> 00:02:04.630
The people of Hartlepool have embraced this
monkey hanging business unreservedly!

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:11.410
In fact, Hank, since 1999 the mascot of Hartlepool's
football team has been a monkey named H'Angus.

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:17.300
Get it, Angus is a name and then H'Angus is
a pun on monkey hanging.

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:18.300
But it gets weirder.

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:23.390
In 2002 the guy inside the H'Angus the monkey
costume was named Stuart Drummond and mostly

00:02:23.390 --> 00:02:27.250
as a publicity stunt the team supported Stuart
Drummond's run for mayor.

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:32.000
The only campaign promise he ever made was
"free bananas for all schoolchildren".

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.700
There were also lots of real politicians running:
Labour, Conservative, all the standard UK

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:38.760
parties, but Stuart H'Angus the monkey won!

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:42.980
And then, despite never getting those bananas
to school children, he was elected again in

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:45.210
2005 and again in 2009!

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:51.470
To summarize, Hank, a city in England hung
a monkey who became a mascot who became the

00:02:51.470 --> 00:02:52.470
mayor.

00:02:52.470 --> 00:02:53.870
I guess there are really two lessons in this
for me, Hank.

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:56.990
The first is embrace your history even if
it's bananas.

00:02:56.990 --> 00:02:58.950
Ha, I made a pun.

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:02.310
And the second lesson for me is that we are
always in the middle of history.

00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:06.200
Like, Hank, imagine that you're that monkey,
things could not really have gone worse.

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:10.530
You're conscripted into the French Army, you're
sent to sea which is not the ideal place for

00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:14.721
monkeys to be, you're forced to wear this
ridiculous French Army outfit, and then to

00:03:14.721 --> 00:03:17.030
top it all off you're hung by a bunch of Hartlepudlians.

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:21.120
If you're that monkey you're probably thinking
"Puh, this is about as bad as it could have

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:22.120
gone."

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:24.370
But there was this whole future the monkey
couldn't possibly have known about as indeed

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:27.510
there is a future that all of us can't possibly
know about.

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:32.090
And in that future this monkey becomes a weird
symbol of the community that hanged him and

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:34.410
then gets its ass kicked by AFC Wimbledon.

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:36.730
So I guess it is kind of a sad story now that
I think about it.

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:40.020
But we are in the middle of history and there's
something encouraging about that to me.

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:43.790
I mean, maybe we could make things better
for that monkey, probably not at this point

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:45.440
but, you know, I don't know.

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:47.840
I remain weirdly optimistic.

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:49.300
Hank, I'll see you on Friday.

